# Two hours awake, lid closed included: into the bag, still running, and still
# counting down when it comes out.
clock 14:30 · battery 88 · floor 15

$ awake 2h
caption "awake 2h: two hours awake, even with the lid closed."
lid close
time +1h10m · battery 71
lid open
$ awake status
caption "Open it 1h 10m later: awake status says 50 minutes left."
